{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/IoC Container/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"5f1a2e65-bd7b-5447-9d1d-8cf9d88a7d21","excerpt":"IoC Container는 객체의 생성, 관리 및 DI(Dependency Injection)을 담당하는 핵심 요소이다. 📌 IoC(Inversion of Control) ✅ 객체의 생성 및 제어 흐름을 개발자가 직접 관리하지 않고, 외부에서(컨테이너가) 관리하는 디자인 패턴 Bean ✅ Spring에서 IoC Container에 의해 관리되는 객체 핵심…","html":"<p><strong>IoC Container는 객체의 생성, 관리 및 DI(Dependency Injection)을 담당하는 핵심 요소이다.</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"-IoCInversion-of-Control\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-IoCInversion-of-Control\" aria-label=\" IoCInversion of Control permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 IoC(Inversion of Control)</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ <strong>객체의 생성 및 제어 흐름을 개발자가 직접 관리하지 않고, 외부에서(컨테이너가) 관리하는 디자인 패턴</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"Bean\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Bean\" aria-label=\"Bean permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Bean</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ <strong>Spring에서 IoC Container에 의해 관리되는 객체</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"핵심-개념\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%95%B5%EC%8B%AC-%EA%B0%9C%EB%85%90\" aria-label=\"핵심 개념 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>핵심 개념</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ IoC Container는 DI를 통해 객체 간 의존 관계를 느슨하게 만든다.</strong><br>\n<strong>🔹 전통적인 방식</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>engine <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Car 객체에 필요한 Engine() 객체를 직접 생성해 <strong>Car 객체가 Engine 객체에 강결합</strong>되어있다.</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 IoC 방식</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">start</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token class-name\">System</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>out<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">println</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Engine Started!\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Autowired</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>engine <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>IoC Container가 Car 객체에 Engine 객체를 <strong>주입(DI)해 결합을 느슨하게 만든다.</strong>  </p>\n<p><strong>🔹 장점</strong>  </p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>결합도 감소</strong></li>\n<li><strong>객체 관리 자동화</strong></li>\n<li><strong>유지보수성 증가</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"Bean-등록-방법\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Bean-%EB%93%B1%EB%A1%9D-%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" aria-label=\"Bean 등록 방법 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Bean 등록 방법</strong></h3>\n<p>Spring IoC 컨테이너에서 Bean을 등록하는 방법은 크게 <strong>세 가지</strong>가 있다.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>방법</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n<th>사용 예시</th>\n<th>특징</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>XML 기반 설정</strong></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">beans.xml</code> 파일을 사용하여 Bean을 정의</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">&lt;bean id=\"myBean\" class=\"com.example.MyBean\"/></code></td>\n<td>Spring의 초창기 방식으로 최근 거의 사용되지 않음</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Java 기반 설정</strong></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@Configuration</code> + <code class=\"language-text\">@Bean</code> 사용</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@Bean public MyBean myBean() { return new MyBean(); }</code></td>\n<td>Java 코드만으로 설정 가능해 가독성이 좋아 일부 경우 사용됨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Annotation 기반 설정 (자동 스캔)</strong></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@Component</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">@Service</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">@Repository</code>, <code class=\"language-text\">@Controller</code> 사용</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">@Component public class MyBean {}</code></td>\n<td>가장 많이 사용됨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"DI-방식\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#DI-%EB%B0%A9%EC%8B%9D\" aria-label=\"DI 방식 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>DI 방식</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>🔹 생성자 주입</strong>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">final</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Autowired</span> \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>engine <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>장점</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>불변성 보장: final 필드를 사용해 값이 변경되지 않도록 함</li>\n<li>의존성 누락 방지: Bean 생성 시 주입이 강제됨</li>\n<li>순환 의존성 감지 가능: 애플리케이션 실행 시 순환 의존성을 바로 감지해 예외 발생</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 필드 주입</strong>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Autowired</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>장점</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>코드가 간결</li>\n<li>테스트 시 쉽게 Mocking 가능(<code class=\"language-text\">@MockBean</code> 사용 가능)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>단점</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>불변성 보장X</strong></li>\n<li><strong>DI가 강제되지 않음</strong>: 객체가 생성된 후에도 null일 가능성이 있음</li>\n<li><strong>순환 의존성 감지 어려움</strong>: 실행 중 예외가 발생할 수 있음\n필드 주입은 권장되지 않는다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 세터 주입</strong>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Component</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Car</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">private</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token annotation punctuation\">@Autowired</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"token function\">setEngine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">Engine</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">this</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>engine <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> engine<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>장점</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>선택적 의존성 주입 가능</strong>: 필요할 때만 의존성을 변경할 수 있음</li>\n<li><strong>Spring 컨텍스트 없이도 객체 생성 가능</strong>: 테스트에 용이</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>단점</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>필드가 null일 수 있음</strong>: 주입하지 않으면 런타임 오류 발생 가능</li>\n<li><strong>객체의 일관성을 유지하기 어려움</strong>: 생성 후에도 값이 변경될 가능성이 있음</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>⭐️ Spring Boot 공식 문서에도 생성자 주입을 권장</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-Container의-종류\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-Container%EC%9D%98-%EC%A2%85%EB%A5%98\" aria-label=\" Container의 종류 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 Container의 종류</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"BeanFactory\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#BeanFactory\" aria-label=\"BeanFactory permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>BeanFactory</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅  가장 기본적인 IoC 컨테이너 인터페이스</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹 Bean 생성 시점</strong><br>\ngetBean() 호출 시 생성</p>\n<h3 id=\"ApplicationContext\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#ApplicationContext\" aria-label=\"ApplicationContext permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>ApplicationContext</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>✅ BeanFactory를 확장한 형태로, 보다 다양한 기능 제공</strong></p>\n<p><strong>🔹 Bean 생성 시점</strong><br>\n컨테이너 초기화 시점에서 미리 생성</p>\n<p><strong>🔹 장점</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>AOP 지원 (Transaction, Security와 쉽게 결합 가능)</li>\n<li>Event 시스템과 통합</li>\n<li>국제화(i18n) 지원을 통한 다국어 메시지 관리</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Spring Boot에서는 <strong>자동으로 ApplicationContext를 IoC 컨테이너로 사용</strong>한다.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-동작-과정\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91-%EA%B3%BC%EC%A0%95\" aria-label=\" 동작 과정 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 동작 과정</strong></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>설정 파일(XML, Java Config, Annotation) 읽기</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Bean 등록 (Bean Definition 생성)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Bean 객체 생성 및 초기화 (<code class=\"language-text\">@PostConstruct</code>, InitializingBean 등)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>의존성 주입 (DI 적용)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>애플리케이션 실행 후 Bean 사용</strong></li>\n<li><strong>애플리케이션 종료 시 Bean 소멸 (<code class=\"language-text\">@PreDestroy</code>, DisposableBean 등)</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/core/beans.html\">https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/reference/core/beans.html</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"IoC Container","date":"February 26, 2025","update":"February 26, 2025","tags":["spring"],"series":"Spring 기초 이해"},"fields":{"slug":"/IoC Container/","readingTime":{"minutes":4.95}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"ce176831-2da9-5cc0-a6b1-e2cbcfe4f0a0","fields":{"slug":"/WAS와 Servlet/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"WAS와 Servlet"}}},{"node":{"id":"7eedce63-46d2-5594-8da2-2be92a40f2e6","fields":{"slug":"/DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DispatcherServlet의 동작 과정"}}},{"node":{"id":"5f1a2e65-bd7b-5447-9d1d-8cf9d88a7d21","fields":{"slug":"/IoC Container/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"IoC Container"}}},{"node":{"id":"0805ba38-d23a-51c5-8cd0-a24b00a07145","fields":{"slug":"/Spring Filter & Interceptor/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Filter & Interceptor"}}},{"node":{"id":"a34f7e04-a092-5e68-8da5-5d4f8a6bf33b","fields":{"slug":"/Spring 예외 처리/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spring 예외 처리"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/DNS/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"DNS"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/Spring Filter & Interceptor/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Filter & Interceptor"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"5f1a2e65-bd7b-5447-9d1d-8cf9d88a7d21","series":"Spring 기초 이해","previousPostId":"9a10c99c-b81c-5d9b-b077-3377231184c3","nextPostId":"0805ba38-d23a-51c5-8cd0-a24b00a07145"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}